# Paying red at the beginning of combat prevents the blocker from gaining first strike (CR 603.2).
[Bot1 Deck]
Goblin Flotilla
Black Lotus
Mountain
Mountain x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Wall of Wood
Plains x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Goblin Flotilla.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Hand.Wall of Wood.Cast
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.PayCost
? Bot1.Mana =
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Goblin Flotilla > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Wall of Wood > Goblin Flotilla)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Wall of Wood.Keywords = Defender
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Wall of Wood.Damage = 2
